       "text": "Tom's bike can't be ready before his Saturday, November 21 race. The earliest is Thursday, November 26. I've drafted the quote message to him for you to review and send.\n\n- **Why the date slips:** The only cassette that fits his bike (12-speed, SRAM XDR) is out of stock. Crankshaft Wholesale is the only supplier that has it, and they need 7 days.\n- **Diagnosis:** The chain reads 0.75% and the cassette is visibly worn, so both should be replaced together. I'm confident about the chain because you measured it. I'm fairly confident about the cassette, since that rests on visual wear.\n- **Work order #1 (locked quote, $269.98):**\n  - Ardent X12 10-36 cassette: $159.99\n  - Ardent 12-speed chain: $49.99, in stock\n  - Drivetrain replacement labor: $60.00\n- **Order plan:** The cassette is planned from Crankshaft and will be ordered automatically when Tom approves.\n- **Draft:** It tells Tom plainly that the race date can't be met and that he can discuss options if he'd rather not wait. I didn't promise anything earlier than November 26.\n\nI haven't offered a stopgap for the race, such as keeping his current drivetrain for Saturday. If you want to suggest one, that's your call.",
